WEBVTT

00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:10.872
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:15.519
Click Edit Telling the Time.

00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:19.627
Click Move to Trash.

00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:24.472
Click Move to Trash to confirm.

00:00:24.722 --> 00:00:30.455
Choose Trash in the side menu.

00:00:30.705 --> 00:00:35.306
Click Restore Telling the Time.

00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:41.352
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:41.602 --> 00:00:47.602
Check that Telling the
Time is back in the list.
